---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="关于 | 帆哥本杰明 · AI 研究院" description="不会写代码的售前，用 AI Agent 把想法变成产品">
  <div class="about-page">

    <!-- ════════════════ 1. Hero ════════════════ -->
    <section class="about-hero">
      <div class="hero-accent"></div>
      <div class="hero-avatar-row">
        <img src="/images/avatar-cartoon.jpeg" alt="帆哥" class="hero-avatar" />
        <div class="hero-text">
          <h1>关于帆哥本杰明</h1>
          <p class="lead">
            <strong>不会写代码的售前</strong>，在 B2B SaaS 和互联网行业摸爬滚打十几年。
            从给客户讲方案、做 Demo、搭渠道体系，到用 AI Agent 把一个个想法变成能用的产品。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════════════ 2. 我的故事 ════════════════ -->
    <section class="card story-card">
      <h2 class="section-icon"><span class="icon">📖</span> 我的故事</h2>
      <div class="story-body">
        <p>
          在 B2B SaaS 和互联网行业<strong>做了十几年</strong>，最熟悉的事是给客户讲方案、做 Demo、搭渠道体系、陪销售打单。
          见过太多企业数字化转型喊口号落不了地，也见过太多好工具因为"不会用"被束之高阁。
        </p>
        <p>
          2025 年 AI coding agent 爆发后，我开始用自然语言"写代码"——不是写 <code>class</code> 和 <code>function</code>，
          而是描述我想要什么，让 AI 帮我实现。从搭建这个个人主页，到做自媒体自动化流水线，到构建一套可复用的 AI 工作流技能包——
          全部由 AI 代笔，我来指挥。
        </p>
        <p class="story-thesis">
          核心命题：<strong>一个不懂编程的业务人，能不能靠 AI Agent 构建自己的数字产品？</strong>
          答案是可以。而且不止是我可以，你也可以。
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════════════ 3. 我能做什么 ════════════════ -->
    <section class="card ability-card">
      <h2 class="section-icon"><span class="icon">⚡</span> 我能做什么</h2>
      <p class="ability-intro">十五年 B2B 商业化实战沉淀下来的能力——不是"什么都会"，但这些事我确实每天都在做</p>

      <!-- 职业路径概览 -->
      <div class="career-path">
        <div class="career-step">
          <span class="career-badge">互联网大厂</span>
          <span>字节飞书 · 阿里 · 网易</span>
        </div>
        <span class="career-arrow">→</span>
        <div class="career-step">
          <span class="career-badge">SaaS 上市公司</span>
          <span>微盟</span>
        </div>
        <span class="career-arrow">→</span>
        <div class="career-step">
          <span class="career-badge highlight">创业公司</span>
          <span>核心创始团队</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 核心能力 -->
      <h3 class="ability-section-title">核心能力</h3>
      <div class="ability-grid">

        <div class="ability-item featured">
          <div class="ability-icon">🎯</div>
          <div class="ability-content">
            <strong>解决方案架构 &amp; 技术商业化</strong>
            <span>主导多个创新产品从需求挖掘、方案设计、研发落地到规模化销售的完整闭环。擅长将 AI/大数据能力转化为可落地的行业解决方案和标准化产品，具备丰富的创新业务全链路商业化经验。</span>
            <span class="ability-tags">飞书 · 微盟 · 阿里巴巴</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ability-item featured">
          <div class="ability-icon">🤝</div>
          <div class="ability-content">
            <strong>高层销售管理 &amp; KA 大客户</strong>
            <span>独立完成企业高层决策者对话到签约的全闭环。具备极强的 KA 大客户销售和渠道赋能能力，多次达成全国头部业绩。</span>
            <span class="ability-tags">字节飞书 · 微盟</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ability-item featured">
          <div class="ability-icon">🌐</div>
          <div class="ability-content">
            <strong>渠道体系搭建 &amp; 代理商赋能</strong>
            <span>从 0 到 1 搭建覆盖全国的服务商与代理商体系，具备管理数千家渠道伙伴的经验，实现业绩数倍增长。</span>
            <span class="ability-tags">微盟 · 创业项目</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ability-item featured">
          <div class="ability-icon">🚀</div>
          <div class="ability-content">
            <strong>创业 0→1 &amp; 团队组建</strong>
            <span>核心创始团队成员，从零搭建团队到大几千万级业绩回款，覆盖全国主要城市。持有项目管理专业认证。</span>
            <span class="ability-tags">创业公司（核心创始）</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ability-item">
          <div class="ability-icon">🤖</div>
          <div class="ability-content">
            <strong>AI + 行业落地</strong>
            <span>深入汽车整车及高端装备制造行业，将 AI 产品能力与企业数字化转型场景深度结合。</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ability-item">
          <div class="ability-icon">📊</div>
          <div class="ability-content">
            <strong>数据分析 &amp; AI 应用设计</strong>
            <span>大数据分析、AI 场景设计、SaaS 产品规划、数字化转型咨询——用数据驱动决策，用 AI 提效业务。</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ability-item">
          <div class="ability-icon">💬</div>
          <div class="ability-content">
            <strong>商务谈判 &amp; 项目签约推进</strong>
            <span>高层商务沟通、需求挖掘、痛点分析、千万级项目全生命周期管理。擅长精准把握业务痛点和购买决策链。</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ability-item">
          <div class="ability-icon">📝</div>
          <div class="ability-content">
            <strong>自媒体全链路生产</strong>
            <span>选题 → 口播稿 → 录制 → AI 转录 → 排版 → 多平台分发，一个人完成一个内容团队的工作流。</span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- 专业技能标签 -->
      <div class="skill-tags-row">
        <span class="skill-tag">解决方案设计</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">技术商业化</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">KA 大客户销售</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">渠道赋能</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">项目管理认证</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">AI 应用场景</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">数字化转型</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">SaaS</span>
        <span class="skill-tag">0→1 创业</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════════════ 4. 一句话 ════════════════ -->
    <section class="card quote-card">
      <blockquote>
        "我不做'技术产品'，我做的是用技术解决业务问题的方案。面向的是那些想用 AI 提升效率、但又不想从零学编程的销售、售前和运营。"
        <cite>—— 帆哥本杰明</cite>
      </blockquote>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════════════ 5. 找到我 — 7 个统一卡片 ════════════════ -->
    <section class="card social-card">
      <h2 class="section-icon"><span class="icon">📡</span> 找到我</h2>
      <p class="social-intro">扫码关注或点击跳转，一起聊 AI、聊搞钱、聊用 Agent 干活</p>

      <div class="social-grid">

        <!-- 1. 飞书群 -->
        <div class="social-card-item qr-card-item" data-lightbox>
          <div class="social-img-wrap">
            <img src="/images/qr-feishu-group.png" alt="飞书AI粉丝群" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="social-label">
            <strong>飞书 AI 粉丝群</strong>
            <span>帆友科技 · 帆哥AI粉丝群</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. 微信公众号 -->
        <div class="social-card-item qr-card-item" data-lightbox>
          <div class="social-img-wrap">
            <img src="/images/qr-wechat-mp.jpg" alt="帆哥AI研究室" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="social-label">
            <strong>微信公众号</strong>
            <span>帆哥AI研究室</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. 视频号 -->
        <div class="social-card-item qr-card-item" data-lightbox>
          <div class="social-img-wrap">
            <img src="/images/qr-video-account.jpg" alt="视频号" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="social-label">
            <strong>微信视频号</strong>
            <span>帆哥AI研究室</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 4. 抖音 -->
        <div class="social-card-item qr-card-item" data-lightbox>
          <div class="social-img-wrap">
            <img src="/images/qr-douyin.png" alt="抖音" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="social-label">
            <strong>抖音</strong>
            <span>帆哥 Benjamin@AI研究社 · 584401655</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 5. GitHub -->
        <a href="https://github.com/wangan0214" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="social-card-item link-card-item">
          <div class="social-link-icon">🐙</div>
          <div class="social-label">
            <strong>GitHub</strong>
            <span>wangan0214 · 开源项目与代码仓库</span>
          </div>
          <span class="social-arrow">→</span>
        </a>

        <!-- 6. B站 -->
        <a href="https://space.bilibili.com/13472754" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="social-card-item link-card-item">
          <div class="social-link-icon">📺</div>
          <div class="social-label">
            <strong>B站</strong>
            <span>帆哥Benjamin_AI研究院</span>
          </div>
          <span class="social-arrow">→</span>
        </a>

        <!-- 7. 小红书 -->
        <a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5c2b8221000000000701bb2d" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="social-card-item link-card-item">
          <div class="social-link-icon">📕</div>
          <div class="social-label">
            <strong>小红书</strong>
            <span>帆哥Benjamin_AI研究院</span>
          </div>
          <span class="social-arrow">→</span>
        </a>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Lightbox 弹层 -->
    <div id="lightbox" class="lightbox" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="lightbox-backdrop"></div>
      <div class="lightbox-content">
        <img id="lightbox-img" src="" alt="" />
        <button class="lightbox-close" aria-label="关闭">✕</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ════════════════ 6. 我正在做的事 ════════════════ -->
    <section class="card work-card">
      <h2 class="section-icon"><span class="icon">🚀</span> 我正在做的事</h2>
      <ul class="work-list">
        <li>
          <span class="work-emoji">🎬</span>
          <div class="work-text">
            <strong>自媒体自动化流水线</strong>
            <span>OBS 录制口播 → AI 转录截图 → 一键发布微信公众号，一个人完成一个团队的工作</span>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="work-emoji">🤖</span>
          <div class="work-text">
            <strong>AI Builder 开发者</strong>
            <span>围绕内容生产、数据分析、客户沟通搭建了一批可复用的 AI 工作流与智能体</span>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="work-emoji">💼</span>
          <div class="work-text">
            <strong>售前 × AI 效率工具</strong>
            <span>用 AI Agent 做方案自动生成、竞品对比、招标分析</span>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="work-emoji">☁️</span>
          <div class="work-text">
            <strong>飞书 × AI 深度集成</strong>
            <span>把 AI 能力嵌入日常工作流：审批、报表、客户管理</span>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════════════ 7. 精选项目 ════════════════ -->
    <section class="card projects-card">
      <h2 class="section-icon"><span class="icon">💎</span> 精选项目</h2>
      <p class="projects-intro">我在做的和沉淀下来的东西，点进去看看</p>
      <div class="projects-grid">

        <a href="https://github.com/wangan0214" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="project-card">
          <div class="project-icon">🐙</div>
          <div class="project-info">
            <strong>GitHub 主页</strong>
            <span>wangan0214 · 开源项目与代码仓库</span>
          </div>
          <span class="project-arrow">→</span>
        </a>

        <a href="https://wangan0214.feishu.cn/wiki/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="project-card">
          <div class="project-icon">📚</div>
          <div class="project-info">
            <strong>飞书知识库</strong>
            <span>AI 知识体系 · 方法论沉淀 · 搞钱集中营</span>
          </div>
          <span class="project-arrow">→</span>
        </a>

        <a href="https://fangeai.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="project-card">
          <div class="project-icon">🏠</div>
          <div class="project-info">
            <strong>本站 fangeai.com</strong>
            <span>Astro 静态站 · Cloudflare Pages · 免备案</span>
          </div>
          <span class="project-arrow">→</span>
        </a>

        <a href="/rss.xml" class="project-card">
          <div class="project-icon">📡</div>
          <div class="project-info">
            <strong>RSS 订阅</strong>
            <span>文章更新通知 · 可接入任何阅读器</span>
          </div>
          <span class="project-arrow">→</span>
        </a>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════════════ 8. AI 工具箱 ════════════════ -->
    <section class="card toolkit-card">
      <h2 class="section-icon"><span class="icon">🛠</span> 我的 AI 工具箱</h2>
      <p class="toolkit-intro">每天实际在用的生产力栈，不是"听说好用"，是真·手上有泥</p>

      <div class="tool-group">
        <h3 class="tool-group-title">对话 & 深度思考</h3>
        <div class="tool-grid">
          <div class="tool-item featured">
            <img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/anthropic/DCA041" alt="Claude" class="tool-logo" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="tool-text"><strong>Claude</strong><span>深度推理、长文写作、方案架构——主力"第二大脑"</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-item">
            <img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/openai/412991" alt="ChatGPT" class="tool-logo" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="tool-text"><strong>ChatGPT</strong><span>GPT-4o 多模态 · 创意发散 · 头脑风暴首选</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-item">
            <img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/deepseek/3C3C3C" alt="DeepSeek" class="tool-logo" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="tool-text"><strong>DeepSeek</strong><span>中文语境强 · 代码能力强 · 性价比极高</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-item">
            <img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/moonshotAI/5B40AF" alt="Kimi" class="tool-logo" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="tool-text"><strong>Kimi</strong><span>20万+ token 超长上下文 · 整份 PDF 丢进去分析</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-item">
            <img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/bytedance/00D6D9" alt="豆包" class="tool-logo" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="tool-text"><strong>豆包 Doubao</strong><span>字节系 · 中文理解优秀 · 响应快</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-item">
            <img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/minimax/FF6A00" alt="MiniMax" class="tool-logo" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="tool-text"><strong>MiniMax M3</strong><span>国产大模型 · 多模型对比参考选手</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tool-group">
        <h3 class="tool-group-title">编码 & 自动化</h3>
        <div class="tool-grid">
          <div class="tool-item featured">
            <div class="tool-logo tool-logo-custom wb-logo">WB</div>
            <div class="tool-text"><strong>WorkBuddy</strong><span>核心工作台 · AI Agent 平台 · 内置文件/浏览器/终端/GitHub 连接器</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-item featured">
            <img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/openai/412991" alt="Codex" class="tool-logo" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="tool-text"><strong>Codex</strong><span>OpenAI 编程引擎 · 自然语言生成完整项目 · 全栈开发</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-item">
            <div class="tool-logo tool-logo-custom codexpp-logo">C++</div>
            <div class="tool-text"><strong>Codex++</strong><span>Codex 增强封装 · 结构化工作流模板</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-item">
            <img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/cursor/0891B2" alt="Cursor" class="tool-logo" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="tool-text"><strong>Cursor / CC Switch</strong><span>AI 原生 IDE · 代码补全+编辑+重构一体化</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-item">
            <img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/docker/2496ED" alt="Docker" class="tool-logo" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="tool-text"><strong>Docker</strong><span>容器化部署 · 一键启动 AI 工具服务端环境</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tool-group">
        <h3 class="tool-group-title">智能体 & 工作流</h3>
        <div class="tool-grid">
          <div class="tool-item featured">
            <img src="https://cdn.simpleicons.org/coze/FF6A00" alt="Coze" class="tool-logo" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="tool-text"><strong>扣子 Coze</strong><span>字节智能体平台 · 可视化拖拽 ChatBot · 接入飞书/微信/抖音</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="tool-item">
            <div class="tool-logo tool-logo-custom skill-logo">SK</div>
            <div class="tool-text"><strong>skills-manager</strong><span>Skill 管理工具 · 创建编辑发布可复用 AI 技能包</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tool-group">
        <h3 class="tool-group-title">内容生产</h3>
        <div class="tool-grid">
          <div class="tool-item featured">
            <div class="tool-logo tool-logo-custom media-logo">M2D</div>
            <div class="tool-text"><strong>AI-Media2Doc</strong><span>口播视频 → 公众号图文一键转换 · OBS 录制→AI转录→自动排版</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════════════ 订阅 ════════════════ -->
    <section class="subscribe-bar">
      <p>不想错过更新？<a href="/rss.xml">订阅 RSS Feed</a> 或上方扫码关注公众号</p>
    </section>

  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page { max-width: 100%; }

  /* ── Hero ── */
  .about-hero { padding: 0.5rem 0 2.5rem; }
  .hero-accent {
    width: 60px; height: 3px;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--accent), transparent);
    margin: 0 auto 1.8rem; border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .hero-avatar-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 2.5rem;
    max-width: 44rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .hero-avatar {
    width: 100px; height: 100px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border: 3px solid var(--accent);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(184,74,60,0.20);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: transform 0.25s ease;
  }
  .hero-avatar:hover { transform: scale(1.06); }
  .hero-text { text-align: left; }
  .hero-text h1 { margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: var(--fs-h1); }
  .lead {
    font-size: var(--fs-lead);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  /* ── 统一 Card ── */
  .card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 2.5rem 2.8rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
